WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,751
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,271 --> 00:00:03,731
A muddy blob is splashing the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,868
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:07,387 --> 00:00:08,942
This is Episode 46.

5
00:00:09,461 --> 00:00:11,869
There is mud on the lemons and mud on the cups.

6
00:00:12,389 --> 00:00:13,206
Maya needs help.

7
00:00:14,406 --> 00:00:17,441
Here comes the sieve gate, with a little wall around the stand.

8
00:00:17,961 --> 00:00:20,934
The gate has one job: it checks everyone who knocks.

9
00:00:21,453 --> 00:00:23,316
Three little friends float up to the gate.

10
00:00:23,835 --> 00:00:25,797
The gate looks, and swings open.

11
00:00:26,316 --> 00:00:27,450
Come in, friends!

12
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,710
Now the blob charges at the gate.

13
00:00:30,229 --> 00:00:32,003
The gate looks, and shuts tight.

14
00:00:32,523 --> 00:00:32,966
Bounce!

15
00:00:33,486 --> 00:00:33,895
Splat!

16
00:00:34,414 --> 00:00:35,242
Nothing gets in.

17
00:00:36,442 --> 00:00:38,478
The blob puts on a hat and tries again.

18
00:00:38,997 --> 00:00:39,491
Sneaky!

19
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,106
The gate is not fooled.

20
00:00:41,626 --> 00:00:42,251
Still shut.

21
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:43,486
Friends get in.

22
00:00:44,005 --> 00:00:46,122
Mud stays out, every single time.

23
00:00:46,642 --> 00:00:47,662
That is the sieve gate.

24
00:00:48,182 --> 00:00:50,249
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

25
00:00:50,768 --> 00:00:53,478
Now you know the Web Application Firewall!

26
00:00:53,998 --> 00:00:55,910
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

27
00:00:56,429 --> 00:00:57,328
Link in the bio.

28
00:00:57,848 --> 00:00:58,800
See you next time!

